WEBVTT

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:20.520
Look, the sky up above has begun to move.
Hora miageta sora ugokidashita yo

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.750
Your astonishment was so dazzling.
Odoroku kimi mabushikute

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.810
Should I forgive the lies you told me yesterday
Kinou tsuita uso mo yurusou kana

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:31.090
just because the morning light is so pretty?
Kesa no hikari kirei dakara

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:38.170
The sound of your laughter is always important to me
Kimi no warai goe itsu datte daiji da yo

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:41.820
because it gives me courage.
Yuuki kureru kara saa

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.680
It's not a lie.
Uso ja nai

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:46.460
It's a beauty really
It's a beauty really

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.610
Your voice whenever.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.920
It makes me have.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:51.660
Even the silliest things sound dear,
Sasai na koto mo itoshiku hibiku yo

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:57.980
Sasai na koto mo itoshiku hibiku yo
Even the silliest things sound dear,

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.540
if it's your voice I hear.
kimi no koe nara

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.810
You're sad whenever.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:05.520
It takes you back.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:08.840
My heart runneth over.
Hamidasu kokoro

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:16.070
Unable to control myself, I set off at a run.
Osaerarenakute hashiri dashita yo

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:19.050
I can forever.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.690
The new semester begins today...

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:38.660
Hey Yui, wake up.

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:39.940
Huh?

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.950
What time is it?

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:48.240
Why are you sleeping with me?

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:52.400
Hmm, I went to the bathroom
in the middle of the night...

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:55.260
But, I managed to keep
my underwear on!

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:00.760
Weren't you going to live alone
once you got into high school?

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:04.770
I just couldn't find
a decent place to live in.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.270
We're off!
We're off!

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:12.060
And that's how the first day of my second year of high school began.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:17.070
A Dangerous Newcomer

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.930
Have you seen the bulletin board?

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:21.310
I don't want to be
separated from Aa-chan...

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:22.960
Hey, Manaka!

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:24.080
Oukusa...

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.960
Aren't you going to look at the bulletin board?

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.280
Oh yeah, some people are changing classes.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.170
I'm in class 8. What about you?

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.580
Erm... class 4. The teacher is...
Kurokawa-sensei?

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:41.700
I envy you. Class 8's
teacher is an old man.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:43.310
Good morning~

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.870
We're in the same class.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:47.340
Please take care of me.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.740
Don't be so clingy.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.100
Kitaouji, you should really do that begging routine

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:56.610
in front of my camera.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:57.880
Jeez.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.110
Sotomura, what class
did you end up in?

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:01.500
Class 4.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.030
Me too, me too!

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.190
So, you're also in the same class?

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:07.040
Take care of me, Satsuki-chan...

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:11.040
Satsuki, Sotomura, Komiyama
and I are all in the same class...

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:14.030
Wondering about Toujou, weren't you?

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:20.100
Manaka-kun, I ended up in class 6.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.170
We're in different classes, aren't we?

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:23.550
O-Oh, really...?

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.010
At least we can meet during club time.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:26.790
Yeah.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:28.960
Well, class 6 is this way...

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.110
O-Okay.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:33.170
I'll drop by class 4 from time to time.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.480
Manaka-kun, come to my class too.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:37.940
Yeah, I'll stop in.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.000
I'm glad.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:44.410
We may be in different classes, but we can still stay connected.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.450
I like you.

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:52.000
All we have on the first day are opening ceremonies and homeroom.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:55.010
I guess clubs wouldn't meet on a day like this.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.200
Satsuki has her part-time job.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.340
Did Toujou just go on home?

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:04.090
That spring break movie date must've been a one-sided thing.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.100
I wanted to talk about our next production.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.960
And how I wanted
to start early this year...

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:13.410
We don't know how many new members we'll get.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.690
I'd like to decide on as much as possible in advance.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.180
Toujou?!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.860
Y-You're the foul-mouthed popcorn
girl from the movie theater!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:31.330
And <i>you're</i> the lovestruck boy
who was with his sweet girlfriend.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:35.290
So much for coming to this school for its film club.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:38.130
Shut up. Aren't you a first-year?

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.700
You're not supposed to talk to upperclassmen like that!

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:45.590
I don't talk nicely to people unless I respect them.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.630
More importantly, where's the one they call "Manaka"?

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:49.930
I'd like to meet him.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.460
"Manaka" would be me--

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:55.690
Hey, how do you know my name?
Just who <i>are</i> you?!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.760
So, <i>you</i> directed that film?

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:01.220
No wonder.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:03.480
You saw it?

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:06.660
I saw it. It had a "so bad, it's good" feeling to it.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:07.910
"So bad, it's good"?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.650
I mean, it could've been made by a grade-schooler.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:12.570
What?!

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:14.990
Aren't I right?

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.990
Simple camera work, simple acting...

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:22.590
Its only saving graces were the lead actress and the script.

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.590
How can you rattle off these offensive things without breaking a sweat!?

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:29.070
That's why I'm going to join this club.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:36.470
This girl's face... looks
extremely cute on camera.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.260
Aren't you in the market for a capable underclassman

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:42.520
with a sharp critical eye?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:47.040
Actually, I think you're more suited to being an actress.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.610
I have no interest in acting!

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:55.040
Eh? Have you ever gotten a good look at your face in a mirror?

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.270
The camera just <i>adores</i> you.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.250
I guarantee it.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:05.380
I don't really value a guarantee given by a no-talent hack like you.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:07.830
This is stupid. I'm going home.

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:09.080
W-Wait!

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:10.850
What is it <i>now?</i>

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.710
Look at what I just filmed.

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.340
It'll motivate you for sure.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.850
Still not interested.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:19.400
I'd hate to see the rare gift you have go to waste.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.300
Hey, what's with that angle?!

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.870
You're trying to get some upskirt shots, aren't you?

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:31.150
What kind of "actress" did you have in mind?!

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:33.440
You attempted to flatter me, but...

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:37.290
You were planning on making dirty movies this whole time, weren't you?!

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:39.700
Y-You misunderstand!

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:39.950
Wait!
Y-You misunderstand!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:40.500
Wait!

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:43.790
Hey, stop running!

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.980
Didn't I say it was
a misunderstanding?!

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:48.470
Yo, Manaka!

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:51.210
Is she going to be your next conquest?

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.960
That's not it!

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.630
She's a feisty one.

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:57.310
How do you know her, Sotomura?

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.810
Her name is Sotomura Misuzu.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.990
She's my lovely little sister.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:02.800
Little sister?

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.140
You pervert!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:22.580
Anyone would've misunderstood something like that, you moron.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.790
Yo, Manaka!

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:27.890
Sorry I'm late.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.020
I thought you already went home.

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:39.380
I was making an appearance at the literature club.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.360
Kitaouji-san, you're not working today?

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:45.220
I took a break. Ever since Manaka quit,
it's been so boring.

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.360
You disgusting creep.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:56.700
Is saying "I like you" and hugging me out of the blue supposed to be a joke?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.930
Is this club full of perverts?!

00:07:58.930 --> 00:07:59.890
Who are you?

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.500
Ah! The girl from the movie theater...

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.470
This is my little sister,
Sotomura Misuzu.

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:08.050
Sotomura-kun, you had a little sister?

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:09.960
Eh, Misuzu?

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:13.800
Why does your sister have such a conceited attitude?

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:17.260
Once you get used to it,
it becomes part of her charm.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.010
This club is completely lacking in discipline.

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:24.530
After I join, I expect all of you to shape up.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:28.280
Wait just a second.
You're only a first-year.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:32.850
You can't exactly make good movies if you're so uptight.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:36.780
Then explain last year's
sorry excuse for a movie.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:40.450
Your swimsuit scene was nothing but fanservice.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.460
Don't you know that that
degrades the movie?

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.790
W-What?!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.820
Are you implying that
I'm an exhibitionist?

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:50.950
I did it because <i>your</i>
older brother told me to!

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:55.770
My brother is a disease.
Feel free to ignore his opinions.

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:59.000
Hey, Sotomura, you're being treated like an illness.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.180
Isn't she cruel? I can't even
photograph her, she gets so angry.

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:04.680
Just the other day,
she took a baseball bat and--

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.050
Why're you always picking fights with people?

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:10.340
Because your personality's so rotten that nobody'd care otherwise?

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:13.860
You actually want people to care about you, right? How childish.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:21.360
I don't have to take this crap,
not from a girl who strips on command.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:24.130
O-Oh no you didn't!

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.740
You cold-hearted bitch!

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:28.100
Who's a cold-hearted bitch?!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.550
What's with this girl?

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:33.100
Whoever she is, she'll
never take me in a fight!

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:34.460
You'll pay for this!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.200
It hurts...

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.000
Don't pull my hair!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.560
K-Kitaouji-san,
I think that's enough...

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:47.430
Sure, I'd <i>like</i> to help her,

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:51.730
but I've never seen my sister get down and dirty like this before.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.040
Are you retarded?

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:55.310
For some reason my memory--

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.650
I guess I have no choice...

00:09:57.650 --> 00:09:59.530
Hey, give it a rest!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.660
Lousy cowtits woman!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.040
What?!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.460
Move it, Manaka.
You're in the way!

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:11.230
Dang it, Manaka,
you're still in the waaay!

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.990
You're in the way, too!

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.430
No!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:30.110
And so, with a new
member in our ranks,

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:32.190
along with additional funding...

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.980
I feel we should definitely
submit a movie

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:39.030
for the High School
Film Festival this year.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:43.820
Hey, how can you speak so normally after a fiasco like that?

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:47.750
I will NOT let you guys have your way.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.610
<i>I</i> will do anything you ask, Manaka~

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:54.060
Well, to get things started,

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:57.210
why don't we discuss the script with Toujou?

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.510
A-A disdainful look...

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:04.510
Yeah, let's try our best, Manaka-kun.

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:07.880
She's even forcing herself to smile.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:14.600
Toujou-senpai, I can't approve
of that movie's director.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:19.580
But I thought the script was good.
Please let me assist you.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:21.180
Eh? Ah, sure...

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.660
I'm back!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.470
You're kinda late, Yui.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:32.000
Yeah, because I visited a lot of clubs.

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:36.700
But wait till you hear this!
Nishino-san is really amazing.

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:39.180
How so?

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:42.730
You see, since Oumi Academy is an all-girls school,

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:45.870
there are always a bunch of boys from other schools

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.860
waiting outside the gates after school.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:51.920
But, almost all of the boys were after Nishino-san!

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:58.980
Nishino...

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:04.470
And the film club, too...
What will become of them?

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.570
[ Hey Sir! Burger ]

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:16.420
I'm gonna take off now!
[ Hey Sir! Burger ]

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.520
I'm gonna take off now!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:20.840
S-Satsuki.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.340
Manaka.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:26.170
You quit, so why are you hanging around here?

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.360
I've been waiting for you.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:33.100
Here... happy seventeenth birthday.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:38.660
Can I open it?

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:39.340
Sure.

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:44.740
A picture frame? How cute.

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:47.450
Aww, you shouldn't have.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.910
It's okay, it's okay.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.210
You're always looking after me, so...

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:54.340
I felt like giving you something a little more tangible.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:59.580
I'm really happy. Thank you.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.470
Y-You don't have to cry about it!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.810
Ah, sorry...

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.510
But I really am happy.

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:11.250
I never expected to get
a present from you, Manaka.

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:16.770
Hey, why don't we go take a picture to put in here?

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:18.180
Please?

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:23.780
Determination! Birthday

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.320
Jeez, quit moving around, Satsuki.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:32.980
C'mon, don't pictures look better when there's a sense of movement in them?

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:37.250
But if you get too frisky, you'll flash your panties.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.910
Maybe I'm doing it to provoke you?

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:44.870
What do you think of my newly 17-year-old body?

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.090
Is it attractive?

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:49.890
Yeah, it's attractive.
Believe me, I know.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:53.260
This kinda reminds me of the old days.

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:56.930
Like when you were filming me by the river last spring.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:03.270
At the time, I thought you were a real freak.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.710
Still, it's strange.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:08.650
Even now... Even now, I still...

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:11.200
like you so much, Manaka...

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:17.410
What was that? For a split second, Satsuki looked so sad.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:21.050
Manaka, this time I'll take a picture with you.

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:24.460
You don't have to.
You're the one turning 17 here.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.530
Think about it for a minute.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:29.420
There's no point in only having pictures of myself.

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.130
Here, pass me the camera.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:33.340
I'm taking it~!

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.900
Picture of a kiss
on the cheek: Acquired!

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:46.110
I can't wait to have it developed.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.990
Your birthday is next week, isn't it?

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.110
Y-Yeah.

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.620
Expect something from me, okay?

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:08.950
Satsuki was bursting with joy over one little picture frame.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:14.470
So why does my chest hurt as if a needle pricked it?

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:18.140
I like Satsuki.

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:20.950
Satsuki likes me too.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.650
But we aren't dating.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:28.480
Expect something from me, okay?

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:33.740
I can't accept it. Even though I gave her a present...

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:36.840
I can't respond to Satsuki's feelings.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.310
May 10th...

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.060
Today is...

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:15.330
Today is...

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:17.980
My seventeenth birthday.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:22.200
Junpei, if you don't hurry up and
eat breakfast, you'll be late.

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.210
I know.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.260
Even though I'll be 17 from today on...

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.800
In society's eyes, it's just another weekday.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:38.040
It's not like the sky's changed colors just because I'm a year older.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.490
Even so...

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:43.310
There's just one thing I'm determined to do.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.960
Good morning, Manaka!

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:47.310
Good morning, Satsuki.

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.150
Happy birthday, Manaka...

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.810
Here's your present.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:57.550
My determination might waver in view of this present.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.830
But... but...

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.800
What's wrong?

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.700
Hurry and open it. Open it.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:07.670
Sorry, but I can't accept that present.

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:13.760
Why? You gave <i>me</i> a present.

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:17.510
I went to a lot of different stores,

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.900
but I have some confidence in my final choice.

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:24.440
Don't you want to look inside?

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:25.770
Don't you want to see?

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:27.980
Your feelings alone are enough.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:32.250
I-It's just that I...

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:35.120
I... I've been thinking...

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:38.920
I'm not confident that I can answer your feelings any more than this.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:41.790
Don't be like that. Just take it!

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:43.290
I can't accept it.

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:46.540
It's fine! It is your birthday, after all.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.330
Think of this as "my feelings."

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.540
I've decided.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:56.460
Decided on what?!

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.470
I hate you, Manaka.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.290
W-Wait, Satsuki!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:03.720
I won't!
W-Wait, Satsuki!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:04.380
I won't!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:08.390
You ignored my feelings and made a selfish decision.

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:12.770
Can't you spare a thought for what I went through in choosing your present?

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:15.540
Satsuki's feelings.

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:19.600
Even so... this might be for the best.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:21.820
For Satsuki's sake as well...

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:27.100
You really don't understand girls' feelings, do you?

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:30.780
You fail. You have
zero talent as a gigolo.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:32.650
Of course I don't.

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:36.220
If you had just accepted it,
Kitaouji would have been happy.

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:39.790
At this rate, you won't be able to play the field at all.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.760
I never planned on playing the field.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.920
Okay, so who do you really like?

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:48.800
I'm guessing you don't want to let go of any of them.

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:51.020
I've never once felt that way!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:52.950
Oh, haven't you?

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:55.780
At the least, don't pull that same stunt with other girls.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.820
You're assuming I'd actually <i>get</i> presents from other girls.

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:02.500
You never know. Toujou might have prepared one.

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:04.900
Could be.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:08.000
You were hoping she would,
weren't you?

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:16.500
That day, Satsuki left early.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:22.680
Manaka-kun!

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.000
Can I have a moment of your time?

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:28.060
Sure.

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:29.550
Umm...

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.340
Umm...

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:35.930
That is... I have something I want to give you.

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:39.280
Here, happy birthday.

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:42.730
I'm sorry.

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.360
I can't accept it.

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:49.410
Satsuki tried to give me a present, too.

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:51.200
I didn't accept it, either.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:53.790
That's why... erm...

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.590
Nishino... -san?

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.770
No, Nishino and I broke up. It's over.

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:05.210
We're not together, and I don't even see her anymore.

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.570
In other words, I...

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.050
It's okay.

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.180
It's okay, Manaka-kun.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:13.740
Don't overcomplicate things.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:17.650
I only wanted to celebrate
your birthday.

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:19.650
Toujou...

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:22.490
There's a notepad and other stationery inside.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:27.280
I thought you'd be drawing concept art and whatnot for the movie.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.100
Erm, but this is...

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:32.340
I'll see you at club, okay?

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:40.180
Satsuki!

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:44.850
I'm out of here...

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:48.290
S-Satsuki!

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:50.100
Manaka?

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:51.640
I'm sorry!

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:55.920
I decided selfishly without taking your feelings into account.

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:02.070
If you're willing to forgive me,
I'd like to accept your present now.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:09.460
Satsuki...

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.410
Happy birthday, Manaka.

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:14.080
Thank you.

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:17.860
Hey, would you open it right now?

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:20.170
I'm sure you'll really like it.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:23.380
Yeah, I can't hardly wait.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.420
